description:
x402-offer-check: x402 Offer Check API: probes a public x402 storefront from the Cloudflare edge (GET, POST, OPTIONS) and reports what a buyer sees - payment-required header vs body, extra, bazaar, CORS, header size, the other method - as findings by severity. $0.01 USDC per check, a live measurement.
Method: POST
Input: {"url": "string, required - the paid endpoint", "method": "auto|GET|POST, optional"}
